## 📐 DATA STRUCTURE ANALYSIS

### **Understanding KeyCapability Structure**

Each `KeyCapability` follows this structure:
```typescript
{
  title: string;
  technical: CapabilityAspect;
  scientific: CapabilityAspect;
  business: CapabilityAspect;
  genomicUseCasesParagraph?: string;
}
```

Where `CapabilityAspect` includes:
```typescript
{
  title: string;
  keyMetric: string;
  description: string;
  icon: string; // Lucide icon name
  color: 'blue' | 'teal' | 'indigo';
  components?: CapabilityComponent[]; // Optional sub-components
  features?: string[]; // Optional feature list
  bullets?: { title: string; description: string }[]; // Optional bullet points
}
```

